<title>CANADA: Canada's Prairies to see snow.</title>
<headline>Canada's Prairies to see snow.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's Prairies were forecast on Monday to see snow, Environment Canada said.</p>
<p>Alberta should see a chance of snow flurries with highs of -5 to -9 Celsius.</p>
<p>Saskatchewan should see scattered snow flurries with highs of -6 to -17 Celsius.</p>
<p>Manitoba should see snow with highs of -10 to -15 Celsius.</p>
<p>Average day time highs at this time of year is +6 Celsius.</p>
<p>((--Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548))</p>
